Package: hmmExtraStatesRepro
Type: Project
Title: Reproducibility Materials for Extra Hidden States under Emission Misspecification
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Aurelien", "Nicosia", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "aurelien.nicosia@mat.ulaval.ca")
Description: R code, fixed seeds, tests, and generated outputs accompanying
    manuscript 4416781. The project implements Gaussian and mixture-emission
    hidden Markov models and applies them to data distributed with moveHMM.
